{"readme":"The planar Earth-Moon L1 Lyapunov orbit at C = jacobi_constant and its unstable and stable directions, i.e. the eigenvectors of the monodromy matrix from each point of the orbit. Points are in the projection (x - x_L1, y, velocity_scale * ydot) of the rotating frame, divided by the largest |y| of the orbit, nondimensional. orbit holds the points, spaced evenly in arclength in this projection. Each strip holds the unit direction at every point of orbit, in the same projection, its half width, and ribs, the indices of the points at which a segment is drawn. multiplier is the eigenvalue of the monodromy matrix along the direction. Each record of arrows holds the id of its label and the point toward which it is drawn, here the Earth.","mass_ratio":0.012153663111117437,"jacobi_constant":3.05,"period":3.565458204603739,"initial_state":[0.7931279522867156,0.0,0.0,0.39661506872952845],"velocity_scale":0.4,"unit":0.21125505095070365,"libration_point":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"orbit":[[-0.2072,0.0,0.75097],[-0.20704,0.02479,0.75068],[-0.20657,0.04957,0.7498],[-0.20578,0.07431,0.74834],[-0.20467,0.09899,0.7463],[-0.20325,0.12361,0.74369],[-0.20152,0.14814,0.7405],[-0.19948,0.17256,0.73676],[-0.19713,0.19687,0.73247],[-0.19448,0.22105,0.72764],[-0.19152,0.24507,0.72228],[-0.18826,0.26894,0.71639],[-0.18471,0.29263,0.71],[-0.18086,0.31613,0.70311],[-0.17673,0.33944,0.69573],[-0.1723,0.36254,0.68788],[-0.16759,0.38542,0.67957],[-0.16259,0.40807,0.67081],[-0.15731,0.43049,0.66162],[-0.15176,0.45266,0.652],[-0.14593,0.47457,0.64196],[-0.13983,0.49621,0.63152],[-0.13345,0.51758,0.62068],[-0.1268,0.53867,0.60946],[-0.11989,0.55947,0.59787],[-0.11271,0.57997,0.58591],[-0.10526,0.60016,0.57359],[-0.09755,0.62003,0.56093],[-0.08957,0.63957,0.54792],[-0.08133,0.65878,0.53458],[-0.07283,0.67764,0.5209],[-0.06407,0.69614,0.50691],[-0.05505,0.71427,0.4926],[-0.04578,0.73202,0.47798],[-0.03624,0.74937,0.46306],[-0.02645,0.76631,0.44783],[-0.0164,0.78283,0.43231],[-0.0061,0.79892,0.4165],[0.0